---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<Base
  title="API Beta Access — SafeMCP"
  description="Apply for early API access to the SafeMCP directory of 28,577+ MCP servers. Free during beta. 100 spots."
>
  <section class="api-beta">
    <p class="eyebrow">api</p>
    <h1>API Beta Access</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Programmatic access to the SafeMCP directory. 28,577 verified MCP servers,
      95 categories, individually scored. Filter, search, sort, paginate.
      Free during beta. 100 spots open.
    </p>

    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div class="meta">
        <p class="meta-label">cost</p>
        <p class="meta-value">free during beta, pricing TBD</p>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">
        <p class="meta-label">rate limit</p>
        <p class="meta-value">calibrated per application</p>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">
        <p class="meta-label">timeline</p>
        <p class="meta-value">access rolling out over coming weeks</p>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">
        <p class="meta-label">spots</p>
        <p class="meta-value">100 total</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <h2>What you'll be able to do</h2>
    <ul class="features">
      <li>Query the full directory of 28,577+ MCP servers</li>
      <li>Filter by category (95 total), runtime, score, source</li>
      <li>Sort by recommended score, popularity, freshness</li>
      <li>Get install snippets, repo metadata, classification data</li>
      <li>JSON responses, simple REST endpoints, no auth headers in beta</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Apply</h2>
    <p class="form-intro">
      Fill this out and i'll review applications by hand. I want to talk
      to people building real things with MCP, so the use case field
      matters more than the others. Manually approved, expect a reply
      within a few days.
    </p>

    <form
      id="beta-form"
      class="beta-form"
      method="POST"
      action="/api/beta-signup"
    >
      <div class="field">
        <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="email"
          name="email"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="name">Name <span class="req">*</span></label>
        <input
          type="text"
          id="name"
          name="name"
          required
          autocomplete="name"
          maxlength="100"
          placeholder="your name"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="use_case">
          What are you planning to build? <span class="req">*</span>
        </label>
        <textarea
          id="use_case"
          name="use_case"
          required
          rows="5"
          maxlength="2000"
          placeholder="be specific. what app, what features, what's the user benefit, what's the volume going to look like."
        ></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="volume">Expected daily requests <span class="req">*</span></label>
        <select id="volume" name="volume" required>
          <option value="">choose one</option>
          <option value="under_100">under 100</option>
          <option value="100_1k">100 to 1,000</option>
          <option value="1k_10k">1,000 to 10,000</option>
          <option value="10k_100k">10,000 to 100,000</option>
          <option value="over_100k">over 100,000</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="company">Company (optional)</label>
        <input
          type="text"
          id="company"
          name="company"
          maxlength="100"
          autocomplete="organization"
          placeholder="leave blank if solo / personal project"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="website">Website</label>
        <input type="text" id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>

      <button type="submit" id="submit-btn">Apply</button>

      <p class="form-note">
        Submissions are stored privately. Not shared, not sold, not used
        for anything other than beta approval.
      </p>
    </form>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <h2>FAQ</h2>

    <details>
      <summary>Why limited to 100 spots?</summary>
      <p>
        Solo project. I want to talk to early users one-on-one to shape
        the API based on what people are actually building. Letting in
        unlimited people first day would defeat that.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Will it stay free?</summary>
      <p>
        Beta is free. Long term, the goal is to keep the API run as a
        non-profit and only charge what infra actually costs to operate.
        No VC-extraction pricing, no surprise rate hikes. Beta
        participants get grandfathered into whatever the final model is.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>What if I'm not approved?</summary>
      <p>
        I'll still reply. If you're not in the first 100, you go on the
        waitlist for the next batch. The site itself stays free for
        humans browsing, that doesn't change.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Can I see API docs first?</summary>
      <p>
        Docs go out to approved beta users along with the API key. The
        endpoints are basic REST, JSON in / JSON out, nothing exotic.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>What happens to my data if I apply?</summary>
      <p>
        Stored on Cloudflare KV (encrypted at rest). Only used to review
        and approve applications. Deleted on request, just email
        hello@safemcp.info.
      </p>
    </details>
  </section>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    const form = document.getElementById("beta-form");
    const btn = document.getElementById("submit-btn");
    if (!form || !btn) return;

    form.addEventListener("submit", async function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.textContent = "submitting...";

      const data = new FormData(form);
      const payload = {
        email: data.get("email"),
        name: data.get("name"),
        use_case: data.get("use_case"),
        volume: data.get("volume"),
        company: data.get("company") || "",
        website: data.get("website") || "",
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch("/api/beta-signup", {
          method: "POST",
          headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          window.location.href = "/api-beta/thanks/";
          return;
        }

        const body = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (res.status === 429) {
          alert("Too many submissions from this IP. Try again in a few minutes.");
        } else if (res.status === 400) {
          alert(body.error || "Check your form and try again.");
        } else {
          alert("Something went wrong, try again in a few minutes.");
        }
      } catch (err) {
        alert("Network error. Check your connection and try again.");
      } finally {
        btn.disabled = false;
        btn.textContent = "Apply";
      }
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .api-beta { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 0 80px; }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .lede {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  .meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px 24px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .meta { border-left: 2px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-left: 12px; }
  .meta-label {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .rule {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin: 40px 0 32px;
  }
  h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 24px 0 16px; }
  .features {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .features li { margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .form-intro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .beta-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .req { color: var(--tier-high-fg, #c00); }
  input[type="text"], input[type="email"], select, textarea {
    background: var(--bg-surface-2);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border-default);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    border-radius: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  textarea { font-family: var(--font-sans); resize: vertical; }
  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }
  button[type="submit"] {
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--bg-page);
    border: 0;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 0;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  button[type="submit"]:hover:not(:disabled) { opacity: 0.85; }
  button[type="submit"]:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: wait; }
  .form-note {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hp {
    position: absolute;
    left: -9999px;
    top: -9999px;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  details {
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 12px 0;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    list-style: none;
    padding-right: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }
  summary::after {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
  details > p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .meta-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; }
  }
</style>
